<title>USA: PaineWebber names Culp Dir of Research.</title>
<headline>PaineWebber names Culp Dir of Research.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc said Tuesday that Michael Culp was appointed director of research, effective immediately.</p>
<p>Culp joins PaineWebber from Prudential Securities in New York, where he was director of Global Research, PaineWebber said.</p>
<p>He replaces Ann Knight, who left the firm, PaineWebber said.</p>
